    <string name="settings_pay_hint">Kartadan to‘lash: Guardarian ochilgach USD va 25 ni qo‘ying, USDT TRX ni tekshiring, keyin Buy.</string>
    <string name="settings_pay_guide_title">To‘lovdan oldin o‘qing</string>
    <string name="settings_pay_guide_body">Brauzerda Guardarian ochiladi. USDT manzil avtomatik nusxalanadi.\n\nNima qilish kerak:\n1. EUR ustiga bosing → USD ni tanlang\n2. 300 ni 25 ga o‘zgartiring\n3. USDT TRX ekanini tekshiring\n4. Buy tugmasini bosing\n5. Manzil so‘ralsa — joylashtiring (uzun bosib → Paste)\n\nTayyor bo‘lsangiz «Tushundim» ni bosing — keyin to‘lov ochiladi.</string>
    <string name="settings_pay_guide_understood">Tushundim — to‘lovni ochish</string>
